WEBVTT

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:07.110
[Web User]!

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:17.660
[Paralyze Bomb]!

00:00:18.170 --> 00:00:19.770
Okay, it's paralyzed!

00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:20.660
Now's our chance!

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:26.380
No way! It can still move?

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:29.010
We have no choice.

00:00:42.090 --> 00:00:43.980
Purple Phantom Blade!

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:56.820
Now! Go!

00:00:56.820 --> 00:00:57.740
Right!

00:00:57.740 --> 00:00:59.370
Here we go!

00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:02.200
[Double Stamp]!

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:07.000
We got it!

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:08.670
Now we can go to Level 5!

00:01:08.890 --> 00:01:10.670
Kanade, you okay?

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:13.140
I'm good. Took no damage at all.

00:01:13.140 --> 00:01:14.170
And you, Kasumi?

00:01:15.130 --> 00:01:17.930
I didn't take any damage, but...

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:23.030
So that's the Purple Phantom 
Blade I've heard about.

00:01:23.030 --> 00:01:25.100
I'm so happy I got a chance to see it!

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.660
Kasumi, you're so cute!

00:01:29.240 --> 00:01:32.290
If Maple was here, she'd be flipping out.

00:01:32.900 --> 00:01:37.460
I can't believe she caught a cold on 
the exact day Level 5 was implemented.

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:40.070
I guess this happens every year, though.

00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:48.920
I'm back! And I'm all better!

00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:51.090
Sure was a long one this year.

00:01:49.560 --> 00:01:55.320
<b>Maxing Defense</b>, <b>Level 5</b>, and<b> Level 6</b>.

00:01:51.090 --> 00:01:53.470
Level 5's been pretty much 
fully explored already.

00:01:53.470 --> 00:01:55.960
I'm still planning to go in today!

00:01:55.960 --> 00:01:59.050
A guildmaster can't just stay behind!

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:01.180
I'd love to help you out,

00:02:01.180 --> 00:02:04.090
but I need to log out for the day.

00:02:04.090 --> 00:02:05.330
Wanna ask someone else?

00:02:05.750 --> 00:02:06.640
That's okay!

00:02:06.970 --> 00:02:09.010
I'll try taking it on alone!

00:02:10.910 --> 00:02:12.860
I know what I said, but...

00:02:13.580 --> 00:02:17.060
It's a boss, so it's bound 
to be pretty strong.

00:02:18.590 --> 00:02:20.530
Hello!

00:02:20.530 --> 00:02:25.740
<b>Oni</b>

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:30.520
Maybe this isn't the entrance?

00:02:29.290 --> 00:02:38.470
<b>Oni</b>

00:02:31.940 --> 00:02:32.940
Should I do this?

00:02:34.110 --> 00:02:36.590
Or maybe... this?

00:02:40.290 --> 00:02:42.470
Oh... Looks like I got in?

00:02:45.910 --> 00:02:49.140
Wasn't expecting a human to show up here.

00:02:50.860 --> 00:02:53.730
I'm gonna defeat you and move on to Level 5!

00:02:54.410 --> 00:02:57.790
All right, let's do this, human!

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:02.820
You'll have to go easy on me, okay?

00:03:02.820 --> 00:03:04.140
[Machine God]!

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:06.870
[Commence Attack]!

00:03:09.050 --> 00:03:10.250
Don't make me laugh!

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:14.460
Syrup! [Megamorph]!

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:15.780
Turtle!

00:03:15.780 --> 00:03:16.990
[Spirit Cannon]!

00:03:16.990 --> 00:03:20.090
Tur...

00:03:20.090 --> 00:03:21.550
...tle!

00:03:26.440 --> 00:03:30.430
That the best you can do, human?

00:03:30.430 --> 00:03:31.870
He's strong!

00:03:31.870 --> 00:03:32.650
[Hydra]!

00:03:41.700 --> 00:03:43.310
In that case...

00:03:54.010 --> 00:03:57.090
Is that all ya got, human?

00:03:57.090 --> 00:03:58.170
Turtle...

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:04.800
A piercing attack?! This is bad!

00:04:06.890 --> 00:04:08.840
Syrup! [Mother Nature]!

00:04:08.840 --> 00:04:09.870
Turtle!

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:13.190
...tle!

00:04:16.220 --> 00:04:19.480
He's too powerful! Regular 
attacks won't work!

00:04:19.920 --> 00:04:22.440
How did the others beat him?

00:04:26.980 --> 00:04:29.370
Oh, yeah! I've got <i>that</i> now!

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:31.210
I don't like getting hurt, but...

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:33.900
Syrup! Return!

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:34.920
Turtle...

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:38.250
[Break Core]!

00:04:57.900 --> 00:05:00.770
Good thing I have such high defense.

00:05:03.880 --> 00:05:04.820
Syrup!

00:05:05.480 --> 00:05:06.180
Turtle.

00:05:06.180 --> 00:05:11.050
I'm sorry! [Break Core] is a 
skill that damages the user, too.

00:05:11.050 --> 00:05:12.750
Turtle...

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:17.460
Um, are you all right?

00:05:20.170 --> 00:05:21.130
Turtle-le!

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:22.680
Not bad, human!

00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:25.760
I lost fair and square. Follow me.

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:27.970
...le?

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:32.140
Uh, what's this?

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:42.940
<b>Congratulations</b>

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:42.940
<b>Congratulations</b>

00:05:32.140 --> 00:05:35.160
You can now enter this 
tower whenever you want.

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:38.050
I'm thrilled to have a worthy heir now!

00:05:38.430 --> 00:05:42.120
What?! Wait, I only came here 
so I could go to Level 5...

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:46.400
<b>Pandemonium I 

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:46.400
"You've acquired the skill [Pandemonium I]"?

00:05:47.140 --> 00:05:50.620
Wait, you mean this isn't 
the entrance to Level 5?!

00:05:51.730 --> 00:05:53.340
Come again sometime.

00:05:53.340 --> 00:05:56.110
I'll fight you as many times 
as you want, so long as I live.

00:05:58.460 --> 00:06:00.850
What?!

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:05.130
I can't believe I went to the wrong place.

00:06:05.130 --> 00:06:07.340
I guess I have to start over...

00:06:08.900 --> 00:06:11.300
Oh? What's wrong, Maple?

00:06:12.270 --> 00:06:17.770
Frederica, Dread, Drag... and... um...

00:06:17.770 --> 00:06:19.450
The rest of you.

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:24.980
You had a cold? That's why you 
were late getting to Level 5?

00:06:24.980 --> 00:06:28.200
I wondered why I didn't see 
a flying turtle in Level 5.

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:30.260
So that's what was going on.

00:06:30.260 --> 00:06:34.600
But somehow it's so typical 
of you to beat the wrong boss.

00:06:34.600 --> 00:06:36.450
Oh, I meant that as a compliment.

00:06:36.690 --> 00:06:39.710
What are you guys doing in Level 4?

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:42.270
I thought you would've 
gone to Level 5 already.

00:06:42.270 --> 00:06:44.090
Yeah, we did...

00:06:44.510 --> 00:06:48.520
But our newbies here haven't been 
there yet, so we're helping them out.

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:52.550
[Loving Sacrifice]!

00:06:53.710 --> 00:06:57.530
Oh, man, that's nice! It 
automatically puts [Cover] on us?

00:06:57.530 --> 00:07:01.070
You guys will be safe from any attack now.

00:07:01.070 --> 00:07:02.530
You can fight to your hearts' content.

00:07:02.530 --> 00:07:04.480
Yes, sir, Dread, sir!

00:07:04.480 --> 00:07:07.530
I give thanks for this 
beautiful AoE protection.

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:11.410
Let's go!

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:14.630
Our patented Trio Attack!

00:07:14.630 --> 00:07:16.160
Plus one!

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:27.880
Why don't you try attacking it, too, Maple?

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:31.060
Sure! I'll try the thing I got earlier!

00:07:31.060 --> 00:07:32.090
What thing?

00:07:32.090 --> 00:07:33.840
[Pandemonium]!

00:07:39.610 --> 00:07:40.650
If you would!

00:07:55.070 --> 00:07:58.600
Yay! Now I can go to Level 5!

00:07:58.600 --> 00:08:00.800
Uh... yeah...

00:08:00.800 --> 00:08:02.940
G-Good for you, Maple.

00:08:02.940 --> 00:08:05.860
Thank you so much for your help!

00:08:05.860 --> 00:08:09.330
I'll help you guys out the 
next time you need it!

00:08:09.330 --> 00:08:10.420
Well, bye!

00:08:12.370 --> 00:08:15.050
Did we... do something to help?

00:08:27.240 --> 00:08:29.330
So this is Level 5!

00:08:31.810 --> 00:08:34.450
This might be even softer than my bed!

00:08:37.780 --> 00:08:39.970
Yui! May!

00:08:39.970 --> 00:08:41.160
Maple!

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:43.360
So you made it to Level 5?

00:08:43.360 --> 00:08:45.580
Is your cold better?

00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:47.880
Yeah, I'm fine now.

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:51.230
Did you two just log in now?

00:08:51.230 --> 00:08:53.550
Ah, no... We were...

00:08:53.950 --> 00:08:59.350
We just lost a battle with a really 
strong monster that uses lightning.

00:09:04.680 --> 00:09:07.940
The two of us weren't enough to beat it...

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:10.900
But if you're with us, I bet we can win!

00:09:15.560 --> 00:09:17.230
Okay!

00:09:17.230 --> 00:09:18.950
[Loving Sacrifice]!

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:29.340
That's the attack that 
finished us off last time!

00:09:29.340 --> 00:09:31.450
But we can handle it this time!

00:09:31.450 --> 00:09:33.110
Let's go, Sis!

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:46.770
[Double Strike!]

00:09:51.510 --> 00:09:53.900
I can tell you've been 
maxing out your attack!

00:09:53.900 --> 00:09:55.490
You're both amazing!

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:57.730
It's all thanks to you, Maple.

00:09:58.260 --> 00:10:00.700
Oh, it looks like we got a new skill.

00:10:00.980 --> 00:10:04.790
Let's see... I guess it lets 
us attack with lightning?

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:09.040
But it's a magic skill, 
so we can't really use it.

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:12.260
Huh? It looks like I got a different one.

00:10:12.580 --> 00:10:15.220
Maybe because my STR is zero...

00:10:15.220 --> 00:10:18.380
Let's see... [Throne of the Heavenly King]?

00:10:21.090 --> 00:10:23.710
Ooh! I like this!

00:10:23.710 --> 00:10:26.810
It's pretty <i>and</i> it grants AoE defense!

00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:30.050
It automatically restores the 
HP of the one sitting in it,

00:10:30.050 --> 00:10:33.100
and it can even seal enemy skills!

00:10:33.100 --> 00:10:34.320
This could be useful!

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:38.460
But you already have [Loving Sacrifice].

00:10:38.460 --> 00:10:43.620
If you can't move around, you can't really 
make use of AoE defense skills, can you?

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:45.540
Oh, it's fine!

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:50.330
It's not like I just get all these 
weird skills because I want them!

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:53.800
It's a message from the admins.

00:10:54.150 --> 00:10:56.550
It says Level 6 is going to be implemented.

00:10:56.550 --> 00:10:58.130
Next Wednesday!

00:10:58.130 --> 00:10:59.870
What? Already?

00:10:59.870 --> 00:11:03.240
Oh, no! I gotta finish 
checking out Level 5 quick!

00:11:03.240 --> 00:11:04.410
Us, too!

00:11:03.420 --> 00:11:06.330
Turtle!

00:11:04.410 --> 00:11:05.910
We're with you!

00:11:46.850 --> 00:11:48.470
[Loving Sacrifice]!

00:11:53.190 --> 00:11:55.090
[Double Stamp]!

00:11:55.090 --> 00:11:56.550
[Double Stamp]!

00:11:56.550 --> 00:11:58.090
[Double Stamp]!

00:11:58.090 --> 00:11:59.640
[Double Stamp]!

00:11:59.640 --> 00:12:02.990
When the whole guild's together, there's 
nothing for us to do but watch.

00:11:59.640 --> 00:12:09.880
[Double Stamp]!

00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:06.920
Well, I'm grateful that I don't need 
to use my Purple Phantom Blade, but...

00:12:06.920 --> 00:12:10.830
Still, we all need to get 
at least one hit in, too!

00:12:17.170 --> 00:12:19.930
So this time, we can all 
go to Level 6 together.

00:12:20.300 --> 00:12:23.820
I was surprised May and Yui couldn't 
beat that thing in one blow, though.

00:12:23.820 --> 00:12:27.640
I guess the monsters get 
stronger with each new level.

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:31.850
But we got some new skills in 
Level 5, so we should be fine.

00:12:31.850 --> 00:12:32.610
Yeah!

00:12:33.230 --> 00:12:37.150
No matter what monsters we face, 
there's no way this group can—

00:12:37.690 --> 00:12:38.390
...lose?

00:12:40.190 --> 00:12:42.780
So Level 6 is a horror zone, huh?

00:12:43.690 --> 00:12:45.530
Sally, are you okay?

00:12:46.100 --> 00:12:47.780
I'm fine.

00:12:47.780 --> 00:12:49.270
No, you're <i>not</i>!

00:12:50.540 --> 00:12:54.660
I'm not okay at all!

00:12:56.940 --> 00:12:59.690
Risa... Maybe you'll have to miss this one?

00:12:59.690 --> 00:13:03.340
<i>I can't! Nope! No way! You know 
I can't stand horror stuff!</i>

00:13:03.660 --> 00:13:07.560
As far as I'm concerned, Level 6 
doesn't exist in <i>New World Online</i>!

00:13:07.560 --> 00:13:11.080
I'll just level up in the other 
areas until they release Level 7!

00:13:11.080 --> 00:13:12.430
I've made up my mind!

00:13:12.780 --> 00:13:14.890
<i>I guess you can't help that...</i>

00:13:14.890 --> 00:13:18.230
<i>But there's a lot of info 
out about Level 6 already,</i>

00:13:18.230 --> 00:13:20.110
<i>so come join us if you feel up to it.</i>

00:13:20.110 --> 00:13:23.060
Okay. Good luck scouting it out.

00:13:26.770 --> 00:13:29.250
If I feel up to it, huh?

00:13:30.030 --> 00:13:32.220
Yeah, no chance of that.

00:13:32.710 --> 00:13:34.870
And there's not <i>that</i> much info yet...

00:13:35.730 --> 00:13:36.620
Huh?

00:13:37.090 --> 00:13:40.210
What is this? An AGI-boosting 
acceleration skill?!

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:42.810
Wait, and you can get 
shoes that let you fly?!

00:13:42.810 --> 00:13:45.860
Oh, man! I want those so bad!

00:13:47.580 --> 00:13:49.110
But I dunno...

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:04.730
Sally! You came!

00:14:04.730 --> 00:14:08.480
Are you all right? I'm impressed 
you made it this far.

00:14:08.480 --> 00:14:11.910
Just getting here was harder 
than you can imagine.

00:14:11.910 --> 00:14:14.990
You should've contacted us. We 
would've gone out to meet you.

00:14:14.990 --> 00:14:20.130
Thanks... But I couldn't bring myself 
to ask that much of you guys.

00:14:20.130 --> 00:14:24.620
Why, though? I thought you 
wouldn't be coming to Level 6.

00:14:24.620 --> 00:14:27.840
Is there an item you want 
to find or something?

00:14:27.840 --> 00:14:31.150
Yeah... And I know where it is, but...

00:14:31.530 --> 00:14:34.470
It looks like a really scary place!

00:14:34.470 --> 00:14:37.560
Okay, okay! I'll help you!

00:14:37.560 --> 00:14:39.800
We hadn't decided what we'd do today, anyway!

00:14:39.800 --> 00:14:41.020
Really?!

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:43.910
Thank you! Thank you! Thank you!

00:14:43.910 --> 00:14:45.440
Okay, let's head out right now!

00:14:50.300 --> 00:14:52.370
Even from above, it looks so creepy...

00:14:52.770 --> 00:14:55.220
Sally, where are we headed?

00:14:55.220 --> 00:14:58.020
There's a Western-style mansion to the west.

00:14:58.020 --> 00:14:59.170
That's where...

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:06.860
Nope! I'm done! I'm going home!

00:15:03.610 --> 00:15:05.810
Sally! Be careful!

00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:07.800
That's dangerous!

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:10.540
Come on, we've already made it this far!

00:15:13.970 --> 00:15:17.350
Sally, we're here! This is the place, right?

00:15:18.620 --> 00:15:20.510
There's nothing around, right?

00:15:20.510 --> 00:15:22.020
Nope, nothing!

00:15:22.020 --> 00:15:24.850
Everything's fine. Just make 
sure we're in the right place.

00:15:30.810 --> 00:15:32.330
Th-Th-Th-Th-This is it!

00:15:32.330 --> 00:15:34.250
I-I-I'm sure of it!

00:15:34.250 --> 00:15:36.530
Okay, great! Let's go, then!

00:15:36.530 --> 00:15:38.710
If I think I can't, then that's the end.

00:15:38.710 --> 00:15:40.990
Clear my mind... Clear my mind...

00:15:40.990 --> 00:15:43.010
Come on, let's go, Sally!

00:15:43.010 --> 00:15:45.750
H-Hang on! I'm not mentally prepared yet!

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:49.200
I know you once took more 
than an hour getting prepared

00:15:49.200 --> 00:15:51.260
for a haunted house at an amusement park,

00:15:51.260 --> 00:15:53.470
so I'm hardening my heart here!

00:15:53.850 --> 00:15:54.940
[Machine God]!

00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:57.260
W-Wait—

00:15:56.530 --> 00:15:58.430
We're making...

00:15:58.770 --> 00:16:02.030
a grand entrance!

00:16:06.120 --> 00:16:08.580
It looks huge!

00:16:09.220 --> 00:16:11.480
So where should we go?

00:16:11.480 --> 00:16:15.370
Uh... Looks like no one's 
shared a detailed map yet.

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:17.990
I know it's in this mansion, but that's all.

00:16:17.990 --> 00:16:20.950
Then I guess we'll have to look 
around the whole building.

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:25.330
Hey, Maple... Maybe we should come 
back after we have more information?

00:16:25.330 --> 00:16:29.470
It wouldn't be efficient to explore it now, 
and the monsters are probably strong...

00:16:29.470 --> 00:16:32.860
Nope! Let's find that item and finish this!

00:16:32.860 --> 00:16:35.340
You'll be fine! You've got me!

00:16:42.110 --> 00:16:44.120
Right! Nothing here!

00:16:46.630 --> 00:16:48.440
Nothing here, either...

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:52.460
This'll never end if we just 
search every room one-by-one.

00:16:52.460 --> 00:16:53.530
Y-Yeah...

00:16:53.530 --> 00:16:56.730
But, Maple... Stay close to me, okay?

00:16:56.730 --> 00:17:01.020
Of course! If anything 
happens, I'll keep you safe!

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:03.750
Okay. Thank—huh?!

00:17:06.140 --> 00:17:08.770
M-M-M-M-Maple!

00:17:08.770 --> 00:17:09.790
Just hang on.

00:17:17.350 --> 00:17:19.550
There. All clear now.

00:17:26.220 --> 00:17:28.150
M-Maple? Where are you?

00:17:28.150 --> 00:17:29.870
Maple?!

00:17:41.280 --> 00:17:43.410
I-It won't let me log out?!

00:17:43.410 --> 00:17:45.080
I can't leave?!

00:17:46.290 --> 00:17:48.200
Maple!

00:17:48.200 --> 00:17:51.220
Maple, where are you?!

00:17:52.070 --> 00:17:52.960
Sally?!

00:17:52.960 --> 00:17:54.550
I'm coming!

00:17:54.550 --> 00:17:56.570
Wait, the door's stuck...

00:17:57.030 --> 00:17:58.260
Sally!

00:17:58.260 --> 00:18:00.680
Where are you, Sally?!

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:02.640
West Mansion Map

00:18:02.060 --> 00:18:04.860
She's running around all over the place!

00:18:04.860 --> 00:18:06.350
Sally!

00:18:09.000 --> 00:18:10.140
[Super Speed]!

00:18:10.140 --> 00:18:13.650
[Super Speed]! [Super Speed]! [Super Speed]!

00:18:15.810 --> 00:18:18.500
I'll never catch her while 
she's moving that fast!

00:18:18.870 --> 00:18:21.530
Okay, then! [Atrocity]!

00:18:23.800 --> 00:18:27.740
Maple? Maple?

00:18:28.600 --> 00:18:30.510
Please come quick...

00:18:30.510 --> 00:18:32.160
Sally!

00:18:32.160 --> 00:18:33.320
Maple!

00:18:37.300 --> 00:18:40.980
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm 
sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:18:42.380 --> 00:18:43.780
Sally!

00:18:44.840 --> 00:18:47.540
Sally, it's me! Just me!

00:18:47.540 --> 00:18:49.190
[Throne of the Heavenly King]!

00:18:53.270 --> 00:18:55.430
Sally, hang in there!

00:18:57.420 --> 00:18:59.080
Maple...

00:18:59.390 --> 00:19:03.280
Don't worry. As long as we stay 
here, they can't come close.

00:19:07.380 --> 00:19:09.490
Well? Have you calmed down?

00:19:09.490 --> 00:19:11.560
Yeah, but...

00:19:11.560 --> 00:19:15.300
I'm super embarrassed, so I still 
don't want to show my face.

00:19:16.850 --> 00:19:19.260
I knew I shouldn't have done this.

00:19:19.260 --> 00:19:22.620
I want to hit myself for thinking 
I might be able to handle it.

00:19:22.620 --> 00:19:25.790
What do you want to do? Keep looking?

00:19:27.690 --> 00:19:30.560
Huh? I wonder what's going on...

00:19:40.270 --> 00:19:41.490
Oh, I get it!

00:19:41.490 --> 00:19:45.430
Some different people came in, 
so the monsters went after them!

00:19:45.430 --> 00:19:47.010
Huh? What?

00:19:47.010 --> 00:19:49.270
That means this is our chance to escape!

00:19:59.220 --> 00:20:02.450
Oh, it looks like we can log out from here.

00:20:02.860 --> 00:20:05.050
Th-Thank goodness!

00:20:05.050 --> 00:20:07.060
Well, I'm not gonna waste any time...

00:20:16.030 --> 00:20:19.440
Way to go, Sally! You got a new skill!

00:20:19.440 --> 00:20:23.090
Let's see... The [Connection 
to the Underworld] skill.

00:20:19.440 --> 00:20:24.660
Connection to the Underworld

00:20:19.440 --> 00:20:24.660
Occasionally, a presence will lend a hand from behind you, forming a strange connection that doubles the effects of items.

00:20:19.440 --> 00:20:24.660
Conditions for Acquisition

00:20:19.440 --> 00:20:24.660
Escape the West Mansion in Level 6.

00:20:23.090 --> 00:20:24.660
It doubles the effects of items!

00:20:24.930 --> 00:20:29.330
I guess you earn this skill by being in 
this mansion for a certain amount of time!

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:31.370
That's great, Sally!

00:20:38.100 --> 00:20:39.770
I'm exhausted.

00:20:39.770 --> 00:20:43.510
I'm more tired than I've ever 
been after playing a game.

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:48.390
Ugh, I'm soaked with sweat! 
I gotta take a bath.

00:20:48.410 --> 00:20:52.390
Risa,

00:20:49.490 --> 00:20:52.390
Mom, is the bath ready?

00:20:54.300 --> 00:20:57.290
"I'm out for neighborhood 
association business.

00:20:57.290 --> 00:20:59.640
Dad said he'll also be home late tonight,

00:20:59.640 --> 00:21:02.220
so please have dinner by yourself.

00:21:02.220 --> 00:21:04.370
From Mom," huh?

00:21:12.080 --> 00:21:13.990
Hello? Risa?

00:21:13.990 --> 00:21:16.290
<i>Kaede, do you have a few minutes?</i>

00:21:16.720 --> 00:21:19.130
Sure. What's up?

00:21:19.130 --> 00:21:22.510
<i>I was just thinking I put 
you through a lot today,</i>

00:21:22.510 --> 00:21:24.260
<i>so I wanted to talk for a bit.</i>

00:21:26.810 --> 00:21:29.390
This has happened before, hasn't it?

00:21:29.390 --> 00:21:30.510
<i>Has it?</i>

00:21:30.510 --> 00:21:33.730
Yeah, the day we went to that haunted house.

00:21:33.730 --> 00:21:38.390
<i>You called me that night during your 
bath, saying you were home alone.</i>

00:21:38.390 --> 00:21:40.500
I can't get anything past you, huh?

00:21:40.500 --> 00:21:44.740
Kaede

00:21:40.890 --> 00:21:43.490
Sorry... Can we keep talking for a while?

00:21:43.490 --> 00:21:46.270
<i>Of course we can. So you're home alone now?</i>

00:21:46.270 --> 00:21:50.970
Yeah. Sorry to ask, but just 
until my parents get back...

00:21:50.970 --> 00:21:53.380
<i>You don't have to apologize at all!</i>

00:21:53.380 --> 00:21:56.010
<i>Oh, by the way, you're good at math, right?</i>

00:21:56.010 --> 00:21:57.960
<i>Can I ask you a question about our homework?</i>

00:21:57.960 --> 00:21:59.610
Sure. Which part?

00:21:59.610 --> 00:22:01.430
<i>Well...</i>

00:22:01.920 --> 00:22:09.930
